  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ds4cFyE.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Banner\" width=\"1652\" height=\"812\"></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>額外燈籠</strong>新增了許多<strong>不同顏色與材質</strong>的全新燈籠！燈籠<strong>可透過空手或紅石</strong>來<strong>開啟與關閉</strong>。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PHjASBK.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns\" width=\"1424\" height=\"1568\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>開啟與關閉燈籠</strong></h4><h5>1. 直接對燈籠點擊右鍵</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CCbMCcu.gif\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns turn on off demo\" width=\"503\" height=\"343\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>為燈籠染色</strong></h4><h5>1. 手持欲使用的染料</h5><h5>2. 對燈籠點擊右鍵</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4dIDXkW.gif\" alt=\"Additional Lantern coloring a lantern demo\" width=\"503\" height=\"343\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>使用紅石控制燈籠</strong></h4><h5>1. 以紅石訊號啟動燈籠</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiW4UXo.gif\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns redstone control demo\" width=\"503\" height=\"343\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>常見問題</strong></h3><h4><strong>我可以在模組包中使用這個模組嗎？</strong></h4><h5>可以，歡迎在模組包中使用本模組</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Discord</strong></h3><h5>歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器，獲取最新內容、未來模組資訊並參與討論！</h5><h5><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"102\"></a></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></p>",
